GOVERNING SOLN FRAMEWORK
The Parties agree that participation in the SOLN Network shall be governed by the Constitution, laws, ordinances, regulations, standards, policies, procedures, and operating rules duly established by the State of Loc Nation Global Public Benefit Corporation (SOLN GPBC), as applicable to the participant and the activity undertaken.
Participants voluntarily agree to follow the applicable SOLN framework as a condition of participation in the SOLN Network and LND economic participation system.
Where a US rule conflicts with SOLN mandatory applicable law, the SOLN mandatory law shall control. The parties shall work in good faith to modify the affected SOLN procedure or activity so that the intended purpose of the partnership can continue lawfully.
