The Participant agrees to comply with:
A. Applicable SOLN rules governing the Participant’s chosen activities;
B. The terms of this MOU and its schedules;
C. The Participant’s own governing documents; and
D. Mandatory applicable law.
Where the requirements appear inconsistent, the parties shall pause the affected activity and seek clarification or modification rather than assuming that one framework automatically overrides another.

